        <mxCell id="legend_text" value="&lt;b&gt;Colors:&lt;/b&gt;  blue = Controller   |   green = Domain class   |   purple = Aggregate root&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Lines:&lt;/b&gt;&#10;  filled diamond  =  composition (whole/part, owns)&#10;  open arrow      =  navigable association&#10;  dashed arrow    =  dependency / temporary use&#10;  hollow triangle =  inheritance&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;GRASP:&lt;/b&gt;  Controller = PlanRouteController, FavoriteController.&#10;  Information Expert = BusTable.findRoutes(), BusLine.hasStop()/getStop(), BusLineDirection.getStops().&#10;  Creator = TravelPlans -&gt; TravelPlan, FavoriteGroups -&gt; FavoriteGroup -&gt; Favorite.&#10;  Polymorphism = Route.getStepInfo() in WalkRoute / BusRoute.&#10;  Low Coupling = controllers depend only on root aggregates (BusTable, User)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
